# Pairs with ReplicatedNotReAudited. The sweep drops its own-region filter, so
# an intent replicated from another region is judged by this region's
# evidence and finalized here.
MODULE: AuditReconcilerResolvesRemoteIntent
TARGET: ReplicatedNotReAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the reconciler resolves another region's replicated intent
PERTURBS: Reconcile

--- FIND
       /\ o \in LocalOps
       /\ op[o].age # "young"
--- REPLACE
       /\ op[o].age # "young"
--- END
